From c44c7404d8e43163658cca9ecc00854b5b04bd4b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mini <mini@local>
Date: Fri, 27 Nov 2026 03:37:38 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 10/10] Optimize local-only startup orchestration and enable
 panic=abort in release

Overlaps AppDatabase, default settings, keymaps, built-in languages, and
theme preloading with AppKit launch; defers Rayon pool, LazyHttpClient,
disabled AI/telemetry/auth subsystems, and unused embedded fonts; keeps
OutlinePanel parallel with ProjectPanel; installs menus immediately;
defers startup keymap error toasts until a window exists; and enables
panic = "abort" in [profile.release] to strip ~50 MB of unwind tables.
